// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#define ZMK_POINTING_DEFAULT_MOVE_VAL 1500  // default: 600
#define ZMK_POINTING_DEFAULT_SCRL_VAL 20    // default: 10

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/pointing.h>

#define Base        0
#define Nav         1
#define Num         2
#define Func        3
#define Sym         4
#define Desk_Switch 5
#define Mouse       6

/ {
    behaviors {
        hm_l: homerow_mods_l {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS_LEFT";
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37 11 12 13>;
        };

        hm_r: homerow_mods_r {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOMEROW_MODS_RIGHT";
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34 16 17 18>;
        };

        hm_meta_l: hm_meta_l {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <5 6 7 8 9 15 16 17 18 19 26 27 28 29 30 31 35 36 37>;
        };

        hm_meta_r: hh_meta_r {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 10 11 12 13 14 20 21 22 23 24 25 32 33 34>;
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        WinNav {
            bindings = <&sl 5>;
            key-positions = <13 16>;
        };

        toggle_mouse {
            bindings = <&tog 6>;
            key-positions = <33 36>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        Base {
            display-name = "Base_win";
            bindings = <
           &kp Q              &kp W         &kp E          &kp R           &kp T        &kp Y      &kp U          &kp I          &kp O         &kp P
           &hm_meta_l LGUI A  &hm_l LALT S  &hm_l LCTRL D  &hm_l LSHIFT F  &kp G        &kp H      &hm_r RSHFT J  &hm_r RCTRL K  &hm_r RALT L  &hm_meta_r RGUI SEMICOLON
&kp GRAVE  &kp Z              &kp X         &kp C          &kp V           &kp B        &kp N      &kp M          &kp COMMA      &kp DOT       &kp SLASH                  &kp SINGLE_QUOTE
                                            &lt 5 ESCAPE   &lt 1 SPACE     &lt 4 TAB    &kp ENTER  &lt 2 BSPC     &lt 3 DELETE
            >;

            label = "Base";
        };

        Nav {
            bindings = <
        &trans     &kp LEFT_BRACE  &kp LEFT_BRACKET  &kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS  &trans    &kp HOME        &kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS  &kp RIGHT_BRACKET  &kp RIGHT_BRACE  &kp PAGE_UP
        &kp LGUI   &kp LALT        &kp LCTRL         &kp LSHFT             &trans    &kp LEFT_ARROW  &kp DOWN_ARROW         &kp UP_ARROW       &kp RIGHT_ARROW  &kp INS
&trans  &kp LC(Z)  &kp LC(X)       &kp LC(C)         &kp LC(V)             &trans    &kp END         &trans                 &trans             &trans           &kp PAGE_DOWN  &trans
                                   &trans            &trans                &trans    &kp ENTER       &kp BSPC               &kp DEL
            >;

            label = "Nav";
        };

        Num {
            bindings = <
        &trans         &kp N7  &kp N8  &kp N9  &kp PLUS     &trans  &trans     &trans     &trans    &trans
        &kp BACKSLASH  &kp N4  &kp N5  &kp N6  &kp MINUS    &trans  &kp LSHFT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LALT  &kp LGUI
&trans  &trans         &kp N1  &kp N2  &kp N3  &kp EQUAL    &trans  &trans     &trans     &trans    &trans    &trans
                               &trans  &kp N0  &trans       &trans  &trans     &trans
            >;

            label = "Num";
        };

        Func {
            bindings = <
        &kp F12  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &trans    &trans  &trans     &trans     &trans    &trans
        &kp F11  &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &trans    &trans  &kp LSHFT  &kp LCTRL  &kp LALT  &kp LGUI
&trans  &kp F10  &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &trans    &trans  &trans     &trans     &trans    &trans    &trans
                         &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans     &trans
            >;

            label = "Func";
        };

        Sym {
            bindings = <
        &trans  &kp AMPERSAND  &kp KP_MULTIPLY  &trans     &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
        &trans  &kp DOLLAR     &kp PERCENT      &kp CARET  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &kp EXCL       &kp AT           &kp HASH   &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                               &trans           &trans     &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;

            label = "Sym";
        };

        Desk_Switch {
            bindings = <
        &trans  &kp LC(LG(N7))        &kp LC(LG(N8))  &kp LC(LG(N9))  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
        &trans  &kp LC(LG(N4))        &kp LC(LG(N5))  &kp LC(LG(N6))  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &kp LC(LG(NUMBER_1))  &kp LC(LG(N2))  &kp LC(LG(N3))  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                      &trans          &trans          &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;

            label = "Desk_Switch";
        };

        Mouse {
            bindings = <
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans          &msc SCRL_DOWN  &msc SCRL_UP  &trans           &trans
        &trans  &trans  &trans  &tog 6  &trans    &mmv MOVE_LEFT  &mmv MOVE_DOWN  &mmv MOVE_UP  &mmv MOVE_RIGHT  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans          &trans          &trans        &trans           &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &mkp LCLK       &mkp MCLK       &mkp RCLK
            >;

            label = "Mouse";
        };
    };
};
